        "cooked": "<p>The magical supercomputers that host GreaterThanGames.com (and associated domains) has been upgraded. As part of this, we've also upgraded some of the software that runs the site.</p><p>If you notice anything, please PM me, <strong>cajunjoel</strong>, and I'll take a look as soon as I can.</p><p><strong>Why you ask?</strong> Omnitron told us to. Really. We do what it says. Would you argue with a sentient robotics factory?&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Benefits:</strong> More capacity! A faster site! Less downtime when uh, amazingly awesome kickstarters are announced! Yeah, that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
